// protoStrokesItem: an item of the corrector's list of alternatives for a
// word that stands for the word's original ink (protoCorrector clones it,
// fills it from the word's strokes and adds it to the list beside the text
// interpretations).

// bounds: the strokes' bounding box; strokelist: the strokes; pickable: the
// corrector sets it true, so the ink can be chosen in place of the text
protoStrokesItem := {bounds: nil, strokelist: nil, pickable: nil};
